{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"f854fb045ae0067cfa61e56096d555de82b1e7d9b02ce4b7aa3d113a78c80611","digest":{"component_or_area":"release workflow (.github/workflows/release.yml)","key_entities":[".github/workflows/release.yml",".github/release-requirements.txt",".github/release-requirements.in","scripts/check_build_env_locked.py","scripts/verify_mcp_publisher_pin.py","tests/unit/test_release_workflow_pins.py","tests/unit/test_mcp_publisher_pin.py","docs/releasing.md","Makefile","pyproject.toml","zizmor","actionlint","pip-compile","mcp-publisher","actions/checkout","actions/setup-python","actions/upload-artifact","actions/download-artifact","pypa/gh-action-pypi-publish"],"problem_keywords":["release supply chain","immutable references","SHA pinning","credential persistence","build tool versioning","OIDC token scope","artifact verification","security hardening"],"propositions":["Release workflows reference actions by moving version tags (e.g. actions/checkout@v7, actions/setup-python@v6) instead of immutable full-SHA commit pins, allowing identical rebar SHA releases to execute different build/upload/publish code across runs.","Build tools are installed with unrestricted upgrades (pip install --upgrade build, --upgrade twine) and the build backend is declared as bare hatchling, preventing reproducible, auditable builds.","The MCP publisher is downloaded from a mutable releases/latest URL with no digest or signature verification, and the download is performed in a job with id-token: write (OIDC permissions), co-locating privilege with unverified binary execution.","Release checkouts do not set persist-credentials: false, allowing GitHub tokens to persist in local git config by default, increasing token exposure.","No generic action-security auditing (SHA pinning, credential persistence, over-broad permissions) is enforced on release.yml, and no project-specific tests validate rebar release invariants (--no-isolation build, job permission splits, evidence wiring).","The release pipeline lacks an immutable, hash-verified record of every action SHA, build-tool version, MCP publisher version and digest, and artifact checksums needed for supply-chain audits and post-release incident response."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785817839572011729,"uuid":"5338e276-18f3-45a3-873e-9bf6d3458c7b"}